description "Dedra Meero

A persistent ISB Leader with a personal squadron to assist operations.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee 
-- Applies Tracking
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed
- Dedra's Power-5 Blaster (3
-- 10% Less Damage
-- Mag Reload
-- Applies Tracking/Knockback/Cripple
- Stun Baton (1)
-- Applies Tracking/Cripple
-- 50% Less Damage
- Flash Bang Grenades (3)
-- Based On Frag
-- Large Quickthrow Radius
-- 0 Damage, Tracks/Cripples/Blinds
- Sonic Detonator (1)
-- Cripples/Tracks

^5Powers:
- Deploy (Summon 1) ISB Tactical Agent)

^8Attributes:
- Rally
- 50% Faster Hacking Speed
- Stat Viewer
- Sense Immunity
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)
- Healing (3)
- Tracking Beacon
- ISB Tactical Agent Escort (Bodyguard)

^3Abilities:
- Quickthrow (3) ^3[CS1]
- Enemy Scanner ^3[CS3]
- Call In KX Security Droid Escort (Spawner) ^3[CS2]
- Tracking Darts (12) ^3[CS4]
- Inform (Force Dispenser 3) ^3[USE In Melee]"